 "verdict": "include",
 "verdict_reason": "Own replication: labels defined from one replicate's locally z-scored GI (z<-5) are recovered by each other replicate at AUROC 0.97-1.00 (MCF10A) and 0.93-1.00 (RPE1); the final labels are recovered by each single replicate at 0.93-0.95 (MCF10A) and 0.97-0.99 (RPE1). Cross-study in RPE1: SPIDR (CRISPRi) recovers the 85 overlapping RPE1 positives at 0.68 (0.65 at the authors' FDR<0.1 call), and this screen recovers SPIDR's 15 overlapping positives at 0.78; not a contradiction. Hit rate 0.42% (RPE1) and 0.14% (MCF10A; low because of the strict cut-off). Single-gene fitness does not predict labels (DepMap 0.52, own SMF 0.57-0.60). MCF10A labels have only different-line cross-study evidence (SPIDR RPE1 0.63, 24 pos) plus within-study cross-line 0.99.",
 "rescored_replicates": "replicates(): GEO GSE343308 counts, final timepoint vs pooled T0, additive GI per replicate (3 reps), centred on 50 non-essential control genes' single-gene arrays"
}